WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.656
Before looking at a sample solution explain your
design The view should

00:00:05.682 --> 00:00:11.227
have one row per employee It should expose the
columns required for

00:00:11.241 --> 00:00:16.770
employee-department analysis The consuming query
should rely on that

00:00:16.783 --> 00:00:22.677
interface rather than rebuilding the join That is
how you demonstrate modular

00:00:22.703 --> 00:00:25.137
design rather than only SQL syntax
